OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tippers face #5,000 fines in
OL,4,Acrackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FFly-tippers face #5,000 fines after
OL,7,Fcouncillors approved increasing the
OL,8,Fpenalty by 400%.
OL,10,FWychavon District Council in
OL,11,FWorcestershire said it hoped the hefty
OL,12,Fpenalty would act as a "serious
OL,13,Fdeterrent" to those dumping waste in
OL,14,Fthe area.
OL,16,FThe council is one of the first in the
OL,17,Fcountry to increase fines, after the
OL,18,Fgovernment gave local authorities more
OL,19,Fcontrol over penalties.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
