OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tippers face #5,000 fines in
OL,4,Acrackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Beverley Hardman, executive
OL,7,Fboard member for the environment, said
OL,8,Fpeople "caught damaging our communities
OL,9,Fand countryside" could "expect tougher
OL,10,Fconsequences".
